    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "wal_compression 的 on 拟改为选用 LZ4",
      "summary": "Tomas Vondra 提议改掉 wal_compression = 'on' 的语义：不再固定用 pglz，而是选构建里最好的算法即 LZ4，默认值仍为 off。Andres Freund 明确支持，理由是 pglz 慢到引发过多起真实故障，用户只能关掉这个本身有价值的功能。Laurenz Albe 也赞成，但担心本轮开发周期已经来不及。已手工设成 lz4 的实例不受影响。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/1314f5843859d5f83d5eb0a47b15d9291567cf40.camel@cybertec.at",
      "author": "Tomas Vondra",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-18",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "WAL",
        "压缩",
        "LZ4"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "CREATE SUBSCRIPTION 的 pg_dump 恢复失败已修",
      "summary": "Jeff Davis 提交补丁，修复 commit 8185bb5 之后 CREATE SUBSCRIPTION ... SERVER 在 pg_dump 加 restore 时的两处失败：DDL 阶段对订阅属主、foreign server 的 ACL 和 user mapping 检查过严，而 pg_dump 先建订阅再改属主，第一步就会失败。这些条件在真正连接前还会变化，补丁因此放宽检查，并补了 SQL 测试。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/35e50b0f80c850e5b9eb1dedcc0844852a2d2de0.camel@j-davis.com",
      "author": "Jeff Davis",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-19",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "逻辑复制",
        "pg_dump",
        "补丁"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PlanetScale 把 PgBouncer 纳入 Terraform",
      "summary": "PlanetScale 的 Terraform provider v1.5.0 新增 planetscale_postgres_bouncer 资源，可声明 bouncer 规格、目标（主库、副本或按可用区亲和）、副本数和参数覆盖，控制面之外的改动也会被检出。连接池关系到连接风暴与容量治理，纳入 provider 后，容量与读写目标的调整可以走 plan、评审和审计。它仍是厂商专有控制面，上线前应确认 state 里不落密码。",
      "url": "https://planetscale.com/changelog/terraform-provider-postgres-bouncer",
      "author": "PlanetScale",
      "source": "PlanetScale Changelog",
      "source_date": "2026-07-17",
      "image": "https://planetscale.com/assets/social-DtnN8vYG.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
